## SECTION 5: SCOPE DISCLAIMER
*(Mandatory callout box)*

Service scope, regulatory applicability, and readiness claims are defined per engagement in a written Statement of Work. Klaravex does not issue compliance certifications or attestations. Readiness advisory and preparation services are not a substitute for an independent audit or certification body assessment.

